{"product":{"id":6236193423548,"title":"Norix Oasis - 4-Seat Cafeteria Table with Rectangle Top - Model O4-3048 \/ O4-3072","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eNorix Oasis cafeteria tables are designed and engineered specifically for dayrooms, dining halls and visitation areas in prisons, detention centers, and behavioral health care facilities. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRectangle top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomic seats provide back support and swivel for easy access\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSizes: 30\"x48\" top, 220 lbs || 30\"x72\", 280 lbs\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdge Style: Molded Edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdge Color \/ Top Color choices:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack edge + \u003cspan\u003eTitanium Evolve top\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWild Cherry edge + Wild Cherry top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKensington Maple edge + Kensington Maple top\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAsian Sun edge + Asian Sun top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMontana Walnut edge + Montana Walnut top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGraham Cracker edge + Palisades Oak top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHM Innertone Light edge + Calcutta Marble top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eBlack edge + Black Alicante top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eBlack edge + Titanium Evolve Game Top (additional charge applies)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlack edge + Stainless Steel inlay top (additional charge applies)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeg type options: \u003cspan\u003e4\" Leg Glides, 4\" Bolt Down, 2.5\" Leg Glides, 2.5\" Bolt Down\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBase type: Fixed Seats or Swivel Seats\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSeat colors: Twilight, Cove, Sage, Clay, Sand, Dove\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeg colors: Black or Metallic Silver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecify bolt-down or free-standing with optional tamper-resistant floor glides\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned as bolt-down (hardware included) or free-standing with optional tamper-resistant floor glides (sold separately)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShips K.D. (knocked down) to save shipping cost\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandard hardware included: Torx tamper-resistant screws, precoated with Dri-Loc sealant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix Oasis tables are perfect for situations where users need more back support than traditional stools provide. Oasis innovative swivel seats allow easy access and provide the comfort of full lumbar support. The molded polyethylene seat shells are durable and easy to clean. Seats attach securely to reinforced, heavy-duty swivel plates with all-steel, tamper-resistant connections. A sturdy 14 gauge steel frame gives Oasis its rock-solid foundation. The rugged frame provides seat support and understructure for the table top. The bottom of the vertical seat tube has a fully welded plate that holds either a large-stem adjustable glide or an enclosed, non-removable anchor bolt for floor-mounting. Heavy-duty cluster seating, designed and proven suitable for continuous use in high traffic intensive-use environments such as day rooms, break rooms, cafeterias and institutional food service areas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Norix Furniture:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNorix Group specializes in providing high quality, intensive-use institutional furniture designed specifically for behavioral health care facilities, hospitals, jails, prisons, detention centers, and other challenging markets. Norix humanizes behavioral and correctional facilities, while building extreme durability and security into each piece of institutional furniture so it stands up to correctional grade use. Norix furniture is as tough as your prison or detention grade environment, yet safe for trustees and staff. Anchortex supplies the complete line of Norix furniture for patient rooms, classrooms, inmate cells, day rooms, lobbies, intake areas, chapels, dining halls, outdoor\/recreation, contact visitation and video-visitation areas, as well as public safety furniture for police and fire stations that looks good and stands up to hard use. Norix meets or exceeds testing requirements for intensive-use institutional and detention grade furniture, and the everyday test of use at healthcare and detention institutions by people who don't necessarily have the best interests of the institutional furniture in mind.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:41-05:00","handle":"norix-oasis-cafeteria-table","updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:32:56-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:41-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dining-areas, cd-furn-cafeteria, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37961016967356,"product_id":6236193423548,"title":"30x48 Solid Top, Fixed Seats","price":"3472.00","sku":"N700233-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"4340.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"30x48 Solid Top, Fixed Seats","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:42-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:32:56-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency